    "Name": "Pirate Wraith",
    "Details": "This Serpentus Series OmniVehicle, Wraith Superheavy Hovercraft, is designed as a Stealthed Support Platform, equipped with Experimental Vehicular NullSignatureSystem, 24 tons of Turret Podspace and a generous 6 tons CASE'd Munitions Feed. Unlike other Word of Blake Tanks does this not have a DNI despite its Advanced Electronics.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 7/11 hexes / 210/330 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Vehicle Adv. Stealth\n<b>Structure:</b> Vehicle Composite\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       200     70\n<b>Left</b>         200     70\n<b>Right</b>       200     70\n<b>Rear</b>        150     70\n<b>Turret</b>      200     70\n\n<b>Total</b>      950    350</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Main Battle Tank</color>\n\n<color=#ffcc00> Omni Vehicle</color>",
